# Artifact files

- One Jira key per folder: `artifacts/<JIRA-KEY>/`
- Replace full file contents when regenerating a phase
- Keep Jira key traceability in Title/Source sections
- Do not invent facts absent from story, user answers, or prior phase artifacts
- Use skill `agent-output` for phase file generation rules
